invalid type: string "7. Mount the Spare Tyre\n• Line up the holes and push the spare onto the hub.\n• Replace the lug nuts and tighten them by hand.\n8. Lower the V ehicle\n• Carefully lower the car with the jack until the tyre touches the ground\nfirmly.\n• Remove the jack.\n9. Tighten the Lug Nuts\n• Use the lug wrench to tighten the lug nuts in a star pattern to ensure even\npressure